# Medaily UI design system (Liquid Glass)

Follow this when adding or changing UI. Source of truth: `src/app/globals.css` + `src/components/ui/*`.

## Typography

- Body / UI: **Be Vietnam Pro** (`font-sans`) — Latin + Vietnamese.
- Brand / wordmark / display titles: **Outfit** (`font-brand`). Prefer brand face on English wordmarks; keep Vietnamese body copy on `font-sans` when diacritics matter.
- Do not hardcode Inter, Roboto, Arial, or raw system stacks in components.

## Tokens only

- Every colour comes from CSS tokens (`bg-surface`, `text-text-muted`, `border-border-base`, `bg-accent`, …). Never hardcode hex/rgb/oklch in components.
- New theme colours: add the token to **every** theme block in `globals.css` (`:root`, `.dark`, `[data-theme='pink']`).

## Surfaces

Prefer utilities / primitives over hand-rolled chrome:

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Panel / card | `<Card>` or class `glass` |
| Modal / sheet / strong panel | `glass-strong` or `<DialogContent>` |
| Floating dock, More tiles, Control Center chips | `glass-chip` |
| Page chrome (header / sidebar) | `glass` + safe-area insets |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg">

// ✅ GOOD
import { Card } from '@/components/ui/card'
<Card className="p-4">…</Card>
// or
<div className="glass rounded-[var(--radius)] p-4">…</div>
```

Do **not** put `backdrop-blur` on a full-screen overlay that wraps glass children — the children then blur a flat sheet and look opaque white. Dim with `bg-black/20` (or `bg-overlay`) and let chips blur the live page.

## Buttons

- Variants live in `button-variants.ts` (no `'use client'`). Import that file from Server Components; import `Button` from `button.tsx` only in Client Components.
- Shape: **`rounded-full`** (iOS pill / circle). Do not use card radius on buttons.
- Materials: `primary` / `danger` stay **solid**; `secondary` / `outline` use **`glass`**; `ghost` is text-only.
- Prefer `<Link className={cn(buttonVariants({…}))}>` over `<Button asChild><Link>` (avoids Slot hydration issues).

## Inputs / selects

- Keep **`rounded-[var(--radius)]`**, not `rounded-full`.
- Use `Input`, `Select`, `Textarea`, `DateInput` from `components/ui` — they already use `glass`.

## Long-form notes / Markdown

Use `MarkdownEditor` for fields meant as Markdown notes (daily, people notes, habit notes, journal, knowledge, reviews). Plain `Textarea` only for short non-Markdown text (chat compose, capture paste, one-line descriptions).

## Shell / mobile

- Bottom nav is a **floating** `glass-chip` dock (inset from edges + `safe-area`), not flush to the screen bottom.
- Respect `env(safe-area-inset-*)` / `--safe-*` on sticky headers and fixed chrome. Root viewport uses `viewportFit: 'cover'`.
- iPhone notch ears: put `glass` / `glass-strong` **on** the sticky/fixed root (Safari 26 samples that node’s `background-color` + `backdrop-filter`). Do **not** move the fill to an absolute child if you want the status-bar ears to tint with the chrome.

## Checklist before shipping UI

1. No raw colour literals.
2. New panels use `Card` / `glass` / `glass-chip`, not reinvented blur stacks.
3. Buttons pill-shaped; fields use `--radius`.
4. Markdown note fields use `MarkdownEditor`.
